{"flow": "non-implementation-commit", "desc": "非实施提交: 机械检查, 作者自查与起草提交说明, 必要时一轮不复审的要求符合审核, 然后提交. 不运行 Spec Readiness 或 Commit Audit.", "entry": "checks", "returns": {"committed": "已提交", "reclassify": "候选变了, 回到暂存与分类", "cancelled": "用户停止"}}
{"id": "checks", "type": "program", "desc": "`arw text check`, 非实施分类的全部机械检查, 加仓库配置的补充检查.", "primitive": "checks.run", "args": {"checkIds": ["text-check", "verify-non-implementation"], "commands": "$param.validation.nonImplementationCommands"}, "next": {"pass": "reviewed", "fail": "fix"}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5", "skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#8"]}
{"id": "fix", "type": "agent", "desc": "作者会话修正机械检查失败.", "work": "author", "next": {"fixed": "return:reclassify", "ask-user:stop": "return:cancelled"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "非实施提交的机械检查或仓库 hook 失败, 失败输出见输入. 修正候选使其通过; 修正不得把实施工作带入候选. 无法在授权范围内修正时交用户并写明原因.", "inputs": ["$state.checkFailures", "$state.hookOutput"], "output": {"branch": ["fixed", "ask-user"], "fields": {"question": "string?"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#8"]}
{"id": "reviewed", "type": "program", "desc": "已做过那一轮审核并修正过的候选直接提交, 不复审.", "primitive": "instance.flag", "args": {"name": "niReviewed"}, "next": {"set": "commit", "unset": "selfcheck"}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5"]}
{"id": "selfcheck", "type": "agent", "desc": "一个请求里完成自查和提交说明.", "work": "author", "next": {"ready": "review", "fixed": "return:reclassify", "ask-user:stop": "return:cancelled"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "用 grep 自查本次规则与文档改动的跨文档引用和副本一致性, 发现问题直接修正. 起草提交说明: 遵循 Conventional Commits 1.0.0, 标题 `<type>[optional scope][!]: <description>`, 描述简短, 祈使语气; 多处无 issue 授权的规则与文档改动合并为一个提交时, 正文逐项写明修改原因和目的.", "inputs": ["$state.stagedDiff"], "output": {"branch": ["ready", "fixed", "ask-user"], "fields": {"commitMessage": "string", "question": "string?"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#5", "skills/commit/SKILL.md#6"]}
{"id": "review", "type": "call", "desc": "改动审核系统或长期规范合同条款时的一轮要求符合审核.", "call": "non-implementation-review", "next": {"pass": "commit", "restage": "return:reclassify", "stopped": "return:cancelled"}}
{"id": "commit", "type": "call", "desc": "提交; 必须先通过机械检查.", "call": "git-commit", "next": {"committed": "return:committed", "hook-failed": "fix", "restage": "return:reclassify", "stopped": "return:cancelled"}, "requiresBefore": ["edge:checks/pass"], "src": ["skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#8", "skills/commit/non-implementation-workflow.md#9"]}
